  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/iobcat3/). VERDICT: CURRENT. 2026-11-01 review at 100b6fbb6e: go-x-sys-and-grpc.yaml:85-88 still rows grpc Dial/DialContext/NewClient net_send; no Invoke/NewStream/ClientConn row anywhere. Fixture: NewClient -> net_send; conn.Invoke -> external_potential google.golang.org/grpc.Client.Invoke (receiver typed grpc.Client by name heuristic, real type *grpc.ClientConn); with grpc.Dial the Invoke call emits nothing. Fix needs library_signatures NewClient/Dial/DialContext -> grpc.ClientConn before a ClientConn.Invoke/NewStream row can be reached. MECHANISM: constructor rowed as a transfer (overlay outside INV-gujoh's scan) plus constructor return type inferred from its name. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-lotaz,WI-novap,WI-lasih,WI-tavir,WI-himij."  # 9b05
